lt":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":25,"created_at":"2025-02-11T08:07:25Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T07:12:35Z","closed_at":"2025-05-06T13:50:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.4.beta3\n- Not reproducible in: v4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta3 - macOS Sonoma (14.5.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nUpon doing LightmapGI baking on my Apple Silicon Mac while the project is on Compatibility renderer, this shows up.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea012bb1-e6b6-49fe-b173-70cbbdada145)\n\nand here's the error.\n```\n  ERROR: drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp:763 - Condition \"t->is_render_target\" is true.\n  ERROR: Failed loading resource: res://lightmap_gi.exr. Make sure resources have been imported by opening the project in the editor at least once.\n  ERROR: scene/3d/lightmap_gi.cpp:878 - Condition \"t.is_null()\" is true. Returning: LightmapGI::BAKE_ERROR_CANT_CREATE_IMAGE\n  ERROR: scene/3d/lightmap_gi.cpp:1293 - Condition \"save_err != BAKE_ERROR_OK\" is true. Returning: save_err\n```\n\nSwitching the project to either Mobile or Forward+ won't show this error, and baking works normally.\nHowever this is not a normal behavior since baking works normally on Compatibility render on Linux. (My device is Ubuntu 20.04)\n\n---\n\nIn addition, opening said baked lightmap back to Compatibility will result in error.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/456cc402-19b6-410c-9afa-e8b7aed1310e)\n\nThat error shows up, and crashed my engine. (This one was not the MRP)\n\nFull crash log: https://pastebin.com/7hLrbfii\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Download and open the MRP project\n- Open lightmap_gi.tscn\n- Make sure currently the renderer (top right) is Mobile)\n- Click on the LightmapGI node, then click Bake Lightmap\n- Save the bake file anywhere\n\nAt this point, baking should happen normally.\n- remove the lmbake and exr file from the filesystem dock\n- reset the light data property of the LightmapGI node\n- change renderer to Compatibility, and let the project restart\n- repeat the same step above to bake\n- notice that now the baking is failed with errors\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mac-lightmap-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18746707/mac-lightmap-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102696/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102696/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}